        "rationale": "The 7facbb1c root has no abseil-cpp, googletest or benchmark, so the vendored gVisor C++ syscall tests can only resolve those dependencies through host pkg-config system libraries and cannot build inside the pinned root. This repin moves the pin to the reproducible build of the flake that carries the three pinned packages in nativeLibs, so the pinned image is a reproducible pure function of its locked inputs and contains every library a gated cell names."
    },
